00:02:50.799 --> 00:03:08.799
Export browser records. Hosted recovery explains which worker tools require the local application.

00:03:13.451 --> 00:03:28.451
Keep the original trade thesis and evidence for later review.

00:03:28.587 --> 00:03:44.587
Historical evidence: manual BTC open and full supervised close verified on Hideki.

00:03:44.734 --> 00:04:04.734
Trend entry and Guardian cancellation verified. Breakout and Mean Reversion live entries remain unverified. Autonomous execution is disabled.

